================================================================================
Third-party components and licenses
================================================================================

This repository vendors and depends on the following open-source projects.
The full text of each license is reproduced under hw/vendor/<name>/LICENSE
when the upstream project is checked into util/vendor.py.

  - lowRISC OpenTitan primitives (Apache-2.0)
      https://github.com/lowRISC/opentitan
  - PULP common cells (Solderpad 0.51)
      https://github.com/pulp-platform/common_cells
  - PULP RedMulE (Solderpad 0.51)
      https://github.com/pulp-platform/redmule
  - OpenHW Group CVA6 (Apache-2.0 / Solderpad 0.51 mixed)
      https://github.com/openhwgroup/cva6
  - LiteDRAM (BSD-2-Clause) -- referenced for scheduler/bank-machine architecture
      https://github.com/enjoy-digital/litedram
  - DRAMsim3 (MIT)
      https://github.com/umd-memsys/DRAMsim3
  - ASAP7 PDK (BSD-3-Clause)
      https://github.com/The-OpenROAD-Project/asap7
  - SkyWater 130 PDK (Apache-2.0)
      https://github.com/google/skywater-pdk
  - IHP SG13G2 PDK (Apache-2.0)
      https://github.com/IHP-GmbH/IHP-Open-PDK
  - SiliconCompiler (Apache-2.0)
      https://github.com/siliconcompiler/siliconcompiler
  - OSS CAD Suite (mixed Apache-2.0 / ISC / BSD)
      https://github.com/YosysHQ/oss-cad-suite-build

The following project is referenced for tooling but NOT vendored into the
RTL repo (per docs/legal/export_control.md):

  - iEDA (MulanPSL-2.0)
      https://github.com/OSCC-Project/iEDA

JEDEC standards documents (JESD270-4 / JESD270-4A) are not redistributed.
Clean-room timing summaries derived from the publicly-available registration
PDF are checked in under docs/spec/hbm4_timing.adoc.
